            "title": "Rich Roll",
            "badge": "Athlete, author, and podcast host",
            "info_text": "\"I'm a freak when it comes to what goes into and onto my body — it has to come from nature. Freaks of Nature delivers, and then some, with zero trade-offs on clean ingredients”"
