            "review": "While suspicious at first, I quickly became a believer after two full days on the beach. My favorite feature of this SPF30 is the consistency of the lotion, it simply feels great. Smooth and with the perfect amount of \"liquidness\" to it, so it goes on and spreads super easy. Really don't need a lot at all, a little goes along way. Great absorption. No strong or any smell really. Sun Protection and water resistance seem on point too. In and out of the ocean all day and only applied once more. No sunburn (I'm very light skinned). Stuff is legit!",
            "name": "Chris R.",
            "stars": "5",
            "rating_link": ""
          }
        },
        "review_WGxp3t": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Sunscreen to feel good about!",
            "review": "Love this sunscreen! I live in CA and as an athlete, I work & play outside almost 365 days/yr. Haven't been the best about using sunscreen in the past, partly because I couldn't stand the smell or was worried about certain ingredients. FoN checks all the boxes, minimal (if any) zinc smell and the unique ingredients are a plant based blend that's not only good for you but also safe for the ocean/environment. Love the company's mission and will support and refer you guys!",
            "name": "Felix B.",
            "stars": "5",
            "rating_link": ""
          }
        },
        "review_R44nzC": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "title": "I'm on my 4th bottle already this summer",
            "review": "I'm on my 4th bottle of the SPF30 and it's hard to imagine using another product. Rubs on so easily and after 2-3 minutes I don't feel it on my skin becasue it has absorbed well.\nMassive fan of this!",
            "name": "Kamal J.",
            "stars": "5",
            "rating_link": ""
          }
        },
        "review_zxyY7K": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Great product.",
            "review": "This worked well on a blistering hot day at the beach with my daughter. It was comfortable to wear. I forgot it was there. Unlike other mineral sunscreens that are thick and pasty. It protected both of us well with no burning at all even on my 9 yr olds face. I will be continuing to use this product to protect my skin from now on. Thank you for a great product.",
            "name": "Sage M.",
            "stars": "5",
            "rating_link": ""
          }
        },
        "review_qbtcyL": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Perfect",
            "review": "Love it. Stays on through a 90-120 minute surf session. Isn't goopy or greasy, easy to remove post activity. It's basically perfect. l've tried multiple 'high end' sunscreens, and never found one that was perfect for me. Until now.",
            "name": "Chadd B.",
            "stars": "5",
            "rating_link": ""
          }
        },
        "review_kizmAV": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Works great for this HI Surfer",
            "review": "I surf all week in Hawaii. Freaks of Nature Speak Performance is more effective than any of the face sticks l've tried. (And I do a lot of pearling, so it gets put to the turbulence test.) The claim is for 80 minutes but l've never had a sunburn or redness and a I'm usually out about 2 hours without redness. The texture is a bit thick but goes on easy, no streaks on my medium toned skin. Accurately no skin irritation or breakouts, either. My new go to, signed up for a subscription.",
            "name": "Valerie H.",
            "stars": "5",
            "rating_link": ""
          }
        }
